{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/3233737012bd589ffaa23c797191f0543a7aa2bfe6cbf07bfde73ba13de2a5d8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79db68a365fe3d1c295a3ce0c56e43103680bab41fd7b95e720320908ca59540.webp","width":78,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"星野千寿子","creatorId":"vndb:s128","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s128","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s128","name":"星野 千寿子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:202143:68555:4210:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c80115","characterName":"加賀 伊佐武","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74481","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"202143"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20821"],"vndbCharacterId":"c80115"},"originalCharacterName":"加賀 伊佐武","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The central character in this tale, Isamu, is currently pursuing his education as a college student. He embodies strength, possesses a kind and just heart, and is driven by a deep sense of righteousness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tragedy struck Isamu's life when he was just a child, as he tragically lost his parents. Left with no one to turn to, he found solace in the embrace of an orphanage, where he spent his formative years."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, fate took an unexpected turn when he crossed paths with Mayuko, and in a pivotal moment, he became her savior. This act of heroism led to an extraordinary change in both their lives, as Mayuko chose to adopt him. In this newfound family dynamic, Mayuko's care transcended the conventional boundaries of foster parenthood, and she embraced Isamu as her own son."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Isamu's deep affection for Mayuko grew over the years, cementing their unique bond. His dedication to her safety and well-being drove him to master the art of swordsmanship, ensuring he could protect the woman who had become his pillar of strength."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As time passed and Isamu matured, he found himself viewing Mayuko not only as a mother but also as a woman. These new emotions often stirred excitement within him, adding an intriguing layer to their evolving relationship."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80115"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編の主人公で大学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"正義感の強いお人好し。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少の頃、両親を人斬りに殺されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後、施設で暮らしていたが、 繭子の命を救ったことが切っ掛けで、 彼女に養子として引き取られる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人である自分に対して、ときに優しく、ときに厳しく、 本当の母親のように接してくれる繭子のことを、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とても大切に思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"繭子を守るために学んできた剣術の能力は、ずば抜けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人になって、繭子のことを女性だと意識し始めて、 色々と興奮してしまうことが多くなっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20821","sourceWorkId":"27663","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編の主人公で大学生。正義感の強いお人好し。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少の頃、両親を人斬りに殺されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後、施設で暮らしていたが、繭子の命を救ったことが切っ掛けで、彼女に養子として引き取られる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人である自分に対して、ときに優しく、ときに厳しく、本当の母親のように接してくれる繭子のことを、とても大切に思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"繭子を守るために学んできた剣術の能力は、ずば抜けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人になって、繭子のことを女性だと意識し始めて、色々と興奮してしまうことが多くなっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74481"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/909a94d543dcb1701b10f30938ee7565ecb995ec672d4c319e70812d057996a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8eeec90ff31ae87e04baae4428d9ce0206aa17e734a679a04af811e6f7c223bc.webp","width":226,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c80116","characterName":"和倉 隆文","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["20825"],"vndbCharacterId":"c80116"},"originalCharacterName":"和倉 隆文","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The younger brother of Mayuko's deceased husband (aka Mayuko's brother-in-law)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Takafumi, a practising psychiatrist, has devotedly supported Mayuko, helping her navigate the grief after losing her husband."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He wanted to take their relationship further and proposed marriage, but Mayuko has chosen to keep him waiting for the answer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Regarding Isamu, Takafumi holds mixed feelings and thoughts."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80116"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"亡夫の弟（繭子の義弟）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"精神科医。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫を亡くし、悲しみに暮れる繭子を献身的に支えてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"繭子に結婚を申し込むが、保留にされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伊佐武に対しては、色々と思うところがある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20825","sourceWorkId":"27663","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"178 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20825","sourceWorkId":"27663","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc1c3c80549fa5b3c0a95f86fccc33bd55f6eb59e43765e219ad6a7f9b50d4f9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8f77fcfb8dade7845649b1dbc7836176b0720377aa8545e2c431c6813772ed01.webp","width":147,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c80117","characterName":"大木久 巡","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74484","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId"